B.K9=s(["Aynaya dokun; \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131n yeni yolunu izle.","B\xfct\xfcn halkalar\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda yak. Geri al ve ba\u015ftan ba\u015fla \xfccretsiz; s\xfcre yok.","\xc7izgili perde a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r ve kapan\u0131r; koyu ta\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 emer. Renk cam\u0131 yaln\u0131z kendi rengini ge\xe7irir. Halka tam rengini ister.","Elmas \u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 ikiye ay\u0131r\u0131r. Prizma k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131, ye\u015fil ve maviyi farkl\u0131 y\xf6nlere g\xf6nderir; dokununca yan renkler yer de\u011fi\u015ftirir.","Yanan her halka kendi notas\u0131n\u0131 \xe7alar; son halka ezgiyi tamamlar.","Ne kadar az hamle, y\u0131ld\u0131z g\xf6kte o kadar parlak yanar. Her y\u0131ld\u0131z\u0131 istedi\u011fin kadar yeniden yakabilirsin.","B\xfcy\xfcte\xe7 mevcut \u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 inceler. Senin yerine \xe7\xf6zmez."],t.s)
B.Kc=s(["Tap a mirror and watch the light find a new path.","Light every ring at the same time. Undo and restart are free; there is no timer.","Striped shutters open and close; dark stone absorbs light. Color glass passes only its own color. A ring needs its exact color.","A diamond splits a beam in two. A prism sends red, green and blue different ways; tap it to swap the side colors.","Each lit ring rings its own note; the last ring completes the tune.","The fewer moves, the brighter the star burns in the sky. Relight any star as often as you like.","The magnifier inspects your current beam. It never solves for you."],t.s)
